{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19221","headline":"詶杨司业巨源见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"詶杨司业巨源见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辟雍流水近灵台，中有诗篇绝世才。\n渤海归人将集去，棃园弟子请词来。\n琼枝未识魂空断，宝匣初临手自开。\n莫道专城管云雨，其如心似不然灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19221.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19221","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}